Pixelfed is an image sharing platform, an ethical alternative to centralized platforms for sharing photography.

This pixelfed instance is run by myself, Adam Moik. I am a a hobby photogrpher and I am hosting as well as maintaining this instance as a hobby in my spare time.

This instance has a strict no tolerance policy against racism, sexism and hate against trans or queer people. We are trying to maintain a healthy and diverse culture and are therefor managing new accounts registrations accordingly. Please refer to the server rules, listed in the about section (in German), to see if this is the community you are looking for.

If you already have a Pixel fed account anywhere else please remember that you don&#039;t need an account on this server to interact with the users here. It&#039;s called a federated social network for a reason. Consider that before asking for an invite to this instance.

The main languages of this instance are German and English

